    "operationId": "hog_flows_metrics_version_retrieve",
    "title": "Get workflow stats for one version",
    "category": "Workflows",
    "description": "Execution stats for a single published version of a workflow, in the same shape as workflows-stats. That is how you tell whether a change helped: compare the version before it with the version after it. The unversioned read in workflows-stats keys batch and broadcast runs on the run rather than the workflow, so it is not the sum of the versions - compare versions with each other, not with it. Set instance_id to the step you are reading, or several steps share one denominator.",
